has been independently verified. Exact scope, limits and current source hashes:
docs/SOURCE_PROVENANCE.md and reports/source-provenance-audit.json.
Historical copyright and provenance are preserved, not erased by rebuilding.
This is not an official upstream release or evidence of approval for the
Obsidian Community directory.

Old payment and public-account QR assets and text placeholders are absent.
